      "info": "Types example phrases into the chat box when the section scrolls into view. Stops the moment someone clicks in."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The phrases themselves are edited in locales/en.default.json under sections.essence_guide.type_phrase_1 to _8, so that they can be translated in Translate & Adapt (Theme > Default theme content)."
